Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Morioh Radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.66,0:00:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As usual, this is your host, Kai Harada,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,keeping you company on this fine morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I've got just the song\Nto start you off right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's dig in, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but before we begin, I have\Na little something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.10,0:01:24.27,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}taisetsu na mono ubawaresou
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.10,0:01:24.27,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}Something important is being taken from me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.27,0:01:26.69,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}nichijou ni magirekonda akuma
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.27,0:01:26.69,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}By a demon that's thrust itself into my life
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.69,0:01:30.06,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}heion nara tokkuni kuzuresatteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.69,0:01:30.06,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}Everything is crumbling around me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.69,0:01:30.06,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}heion na toki kuzuresatteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.69,0:01:32.86,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}nanigenai soshite sarigenai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.69,0:01:32.86,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}Living my life as if everything was fine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.58,0:01:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it doesn't live in peace, I'm\Nnot going to be getting for air.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.86,0:01:35.24,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}kizu ga nai uchi ni ubawareteita
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.86,0:01:35.24,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}Until suddenly it was stolen away without warning
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm not going to be in breath.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.24,0:01:38.70,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}torikaeshi ni iku nara ima sa
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.24,0:01:38.70,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}This is my only chance to take it back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.36,0:01:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to be calling\Nyou one of the times.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.70,0:01:43.04,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}tsuranuita ya no youna surudosa de
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.70,0:01:43.04,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}Those who fight with a heart pierced by the arrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.90,0:01:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you might see\Nyourself being beautiful.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.04,0:01:46.54,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}butsukeau kokoro wa utsukushii
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.04,0:01:46.54,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}Are a beautiful sight to behold
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.54,0:01:47.58,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}doko mademo chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.54,0:01:47.58,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}Anywhere you go I'll chase you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.60,0:01:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.58,0:01:49.21,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}doko mademo chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.58,0:01:49.21,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}Anywhere you go I'll chase you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chasing.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.21,0:01:51.34,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}itsumo chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.21,0:01:51.34,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}I'll always chase you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.30,0:01:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be chasing.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.34,0:01:53.50,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}ore wa chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.34,0:01:53.50,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC3F0FA&}I will chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.50,0:01:55.09,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}nigeba wa nai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.50,0:01:55.09,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}You can't escape me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.09,0:01:57.76,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}hashiridase chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.09,0:01:57.76,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}Run faster as I chase you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll chase you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.72,0:01:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll chase you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.76,0:01:59.89,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}asu mo chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.76,0:01:59.89,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}Even tomorrow I'll chase you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it again, and I'll do it again!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.89,0:02:02.76,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}tataki tsukete yaru no sa
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.89,0:02:02.76,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}Until I finally pummel you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.76,0:02:08.39,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}shouhai wo wakeru nowa shunen sa
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.76,0:02:08.39,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}My perseverance will propel me forward to achieve victory
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.76,0:02:08.39,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}shouhai wo wakeru nowa shuunen sa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.34,0:02:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you the future,\Nso I'll chase you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.72,0:02:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you the future,\Nso I'll chase you!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.39,0:02:14.28,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}dakara I Chase You
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.39,0:02:14.28,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}Which is why I chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.32,0:02:20.91,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(143,900)\fs60}Episode 21: {\fs80} Kira Yoshikage Wants a Quiet Life, Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Mr. Kira?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.20,0:02:19.57,Main,Lady,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mr. Kira? Umm, Mr. Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kira,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.60,0:02:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this is super last minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but would you be interested\Nin getting lunch with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.02,0:02:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologies, but I must decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to finish delivering these\Ndocuments before the day gets away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.56,0:02:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.94,0:02:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your time on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.56,0:02:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd suck the life out of the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.88,0:02:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guys and I invite him out on occasion,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.22,0:02:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we can never tell if\Nhe's having fun or hates us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.74,0:02:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira, age 33, single.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a model employee, that's for damn\Nsure, but the guy's dull as dishwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that he's necessarily\Na tool or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just kind of blah, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.70,0:03:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.68,0:03:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's a little bent out of shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some new girls at work\Ninvited me to lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.94,0:03:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, it's as innocent as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.96,0:03:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I promised you lunch\Nwas our time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never go back in my word\Njust to fraternize with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.06,0:03:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard me turn them down, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the time we've known each other,\NI've never left you by your lonesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now stop this silly fretting and\Nlet's pick out some sandwiches.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.66,0:03:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, which one do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, this one has a delicate texture.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bakery's one of my favorites.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes sandwiches with\Nbread made fresh at 11 a .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all the rage around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd be lucky to find one\Non the shelf after 1 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even through the wrapper, you can\Nfeel they're fresh from the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:04:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The katsu they use is always\Nfreshly fried and perfectly crispy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.62,0:04:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems in all the excitement, you managed\Nto tear the wrapper and make a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a naughty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a waste, but this\Nsandwich is ruined now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose we'll just\Nbuy the one underneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for dropping by.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.38,0:04:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simply beautiful, isn't it? Quaint\Nlittle Morioh, between us it might be
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.80,0:05:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the most marvelous town on earth\Nit's like we're on a romantic picnic
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bit aromatic for my taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.50,0:05:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's time for the\Ntwo of us to part ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end is close at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.86,0:05:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Close at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If luck is on my side,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.88,0:05:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perhaps I'll cross paths with a beautiful\Nnew girl visiting from out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.90,0:05:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh joy, it's a mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.86,0:05:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke and Okuyasu, good\Nto see you! What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.64,0:06:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you got here\Njust in the nick of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get right to the point, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.18,0:06:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to borrow some lunch money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.86,0:06:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're a little strapped\Nfor cash at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to the money we\Ngot from the lottery ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it gone already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.46,0:06:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.68,0:06:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We put all that in the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.08,0:06:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you gotta be crazy\Nif you think we go all
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.14,0:06:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the way to the bank just\Nto get some lunch money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not worth the walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A thousand yen should be\Nenough for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.94,0:06:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.30,0:06:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, as soon as school's over,\Nwe'll head to the bank and pay you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know that logo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a sandwich from St.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gentleman, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.68,0:06:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought they were sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are, and you're not getting a\Nsingle bite of mine, you got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you leave my sandwich alone,\NI'll lend you guys the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet, I can taste their lunch already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:06:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.76,0:07:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just so you know, I'm writing\Nan I-O-U for this little loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.28,0:07:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna weasel out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, you're the biggest weasel there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, June 24th.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.52,0:07:08.82,Main,Josuke,0,0,0,,{\an8}Anyway, thanks again for helping us out, Shigechi! {I'm pretty sure Shigechi never helped them out before, so it should be thanks again for helping instead of thanks for helping again?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.32,0:07:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lent 1,000 yen to needy\Nfriends. Hang on. Lent.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.45,0:07:10.70,Main,Josuke,0,0,0,,{\an8}See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.56,0:07:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you write the\Ncharacter for Lent again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.78,0:07:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll work for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.86,0:07:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess Hiragana's better than nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crud, monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.51,0:07:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to write\NJosuke or Okuyasu, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.94,0:07:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sandwich was right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.62,0:07:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sandwich is safe and sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember being this far\Naway, but at least I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Th-that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Josuke! Okuyasu! Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:07:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.36,0:08:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your thumbprints on\Nmy IOU to make it official!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.30,0:08:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That lump of a brat\Ngrabbed my back by mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, could you be any more annoying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would we give you our thumbprints?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.40,0:08:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.31,0:08:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cut your thumb with a\Nknife and use the blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.46,0:08:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have to go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just sign the IOU and we'll call it good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.74,0:08:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, but let's haul ass to sink\Ngentlemen before they sell out. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let him see what's in that bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's still wearing the ring I\Nput on her finger this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.00,0:08:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has my fingerprints on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when the police open an investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.34,0:08:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll be just a matter of time\Nbefore they trace it back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira has been\Nat this for 15 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and in all that time, he's\Nnever left a single clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This pathetic whelp isn't changing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke, let's head in. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.68,0:09:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stay outside and wait for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.74,0:09:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My best bet is to take it by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On second thought, I'd better\Nsnatch it without his knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a lucky son of\Na gun, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lunchtime rush beat us here,\Nand they're already out of St.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.06,0:09:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gentleman's Sandwiches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just our luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're sold out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.11,0:09:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, isn't that a shame?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for you guys, I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I could sell you mine, but so\Nyou know it'll cost you 10,000 yen, k?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.68,0:09:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, not a decent bone\Nin your body, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.84,0:09:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Josuke, looks\Nlike we're headed to Hokuben.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.82,0:09:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure that'll be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.56,0:09:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt a 500 yen meal and\Na drink will fill us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're better off skipping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not my first choice, but\Nthe cafeteria will do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.52,0:09:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, that's where Koichi\Nsaid he's getting lunch today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.86,0:09:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, man, that means he'll be\Nthere with Yukako Yamagishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.60,0:10:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate having to be the third wheel\Nto those Honeymooners' love fest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the food they serve is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their nasty meat is so thin,\Nit's practically invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who knows what kind of weird\Nshit they put in the miso soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.36,0:10:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't we use the equipment\Nroom at my middle school's gym?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has tons of drinks to choose from.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.44,0:10:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our PE teacher always\Nsneaks away to have his
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,coffee and tea in there\Nwhen no one's looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.92,0:10:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the teachers are in the\Nfaculty room during lunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they won't be able to bust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I'll sneak in through the\Nwindow and take a cup to quench my thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go buy lunch and we'll\Nhang out there and eat together?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.84,0:10:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's back it up there, Shigechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you seriously stealing\Ndrinks from school?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stingy bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.44,0:10:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you even buy drinks for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never see me doing\Nsomething that greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.94,0:10:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.12,0:10:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, what crawled up there butts?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.64,0:10:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, well, you better pay me\Nback my 1,000 yen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.72,0:11:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for bumping into you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.00,0:11:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.91,0:11:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't looking where I was going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.64,0:11:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit. So close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's left his idiotic friends,\Nbut he's heading back to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.60,0:11:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's eating lunch there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's my next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.50,0:11:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe they call him Shigechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.22,0:11:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Minutes from now, he'll open that bag\Nand things will get very complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.31,0:11:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is unfathomable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.23,0:11:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's unfathomable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.22,0:11:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alrighty,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.20,0:11:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that I'm in my special hiding spot,\NI can finally eat my lunch in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.96,0:12:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did I almost forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I start chowing down on\Nmy food, I need to make coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a secret trip to the\Ngym without a freshly brewed cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.70,0:12:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortune has smiled on you, Shigechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.66,0:12:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had you peeked inside, my only recourse\Nwould have been to obliterate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.18,0:12:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chosuke, I think this is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's smaller than I thought. What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.72,0:12:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought these two were blowing them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.28,0:12:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.19,0:12:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You here or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.14,0:12:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigechi! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were going to\Nget lunch somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.40,0:12:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.82,0:12:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't just pass up\Nfree coffee from Cafe Gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got 500 yen maku\Nnochi bentos on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.38,0:12:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.29,0:13:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you two actually showed up\Nto eat after calling me a stingy bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.24,0:13:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a couple of hypocritical pricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, man, cut us some slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you heard of people\Nchanging their minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a thing that happens, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.80,0:13:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Offing one of them would\Nbe a walk in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't tackle all three at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.26,0:13:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, I was so close, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's only centimeters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.52,0:13:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigechi, you mind grabbing\Nme a drink on your way back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And could you make it a\Ngreen tea instead of coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.88,0:13:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take a black tea with milk. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makunochi with milk tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.64,0:13:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, he's going to try to eat his\Nmeal right on top of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't do something fast, he's going\Nto open the bag right in front of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:13:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, not soy sauce again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.22,0:14:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're always giving me\Nsoy sauce with katsu. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how you're supposed to eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way. Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows it's tonkatsu sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.48,0:14:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Putting soy sauce on tonkatsu\Nviolates all that sacred.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.84,0:14:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.74,0:14:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.80,0:14:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.98,0:14:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.52,0:14:46.53,Episode 10 Typesetting 1back,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\p1\pos(1155.714,63.142)\be0.3}m 0 0 l 800 0 800 1000 0 1000{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.52,0:14:46.53,Episode 10 Typesetting 1a,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1159,130)}Morioh Landmark #7
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.52,0:14:46.53,Episode 10 Typesetting 1b,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1159,230)}St. Gentlemen Bakery
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.52,0:14:46.53,Episode 10 Typesetting 1c,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1159,570)\fs59}Location: Two minute's walk from \Nthe bus stop near Budogaoka \NHigh School. It's the bakery on \Nthe green road leading from the\N station.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.52,0:14:46.53,Episode 10 Typesetting 1d,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1159,980)\fs51}St. Gentlemen is renowned for its \Ndelicious bread cooked inside a \Nstone oven. Typical customers include \Nstudents, housewives, and office \Nladies. Their most popular food item \Nis their sandwiches, which \Nconsistently sell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn! Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.32,0:15:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly do you\Nthink you're doing? Talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.52,0:15:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because from where I'm standing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.86,0:15:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it looks like you're trying to\Nsteal my sandwich out from under me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.52,0:15:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.44,0:15:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop being such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came over here because I\Nthought I heard something weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.76,0:15:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was going to check it out\Nand then get back to eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My food's off limits, hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.46,0:15:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can already hear your sappy sob story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.26,0:15:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teriyaki chicken\Nsandwiches are my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so won't you please give me\Na teeny-weeny bite shigechi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me I'm wrong, you can't, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.58,0:15:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, you sure are a greedy\Nlittle stinker, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you focus on\Nbringing out my tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.28,0:15:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and don't forget my milk tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm making them fast as I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.10,0:15:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.04,0:15:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.64,0:15:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get them while they're hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.90,0:15:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One green tea and one black tea with milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:15:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.26,0:16:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.72,0:16:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sandwich disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.64,0:16:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you lunch thieves do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.62,0:16:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lunch thieves? Who, us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.26,0:16:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's definitely gone, but we\Ndidn't have anything to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell him Okuyasu what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of your games.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.26,0:16:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one else here but us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta know what\Nhappened to my sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.86,0:16:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, cross our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not messing around We're just\Nas confused about all this as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.02,0:16:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lying punks. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.54,0:16:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you gotta name me\Nangry. It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of you\Npointing the finger at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would we take your sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna lie, then\Nwe'll do things my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.30,0:16:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is make Harvest\Nturn this room inside out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you are so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, search the room!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.16,0:16:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.16,0:16:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Search until you pass out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.64,0:16:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.56,0:16:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the last time, why would\Nwe steal a stupid sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.32,0:17:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see a thing trapped under here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.74,0:17:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what that pissant is up\Nto, but it can't be anything good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.28,0:17:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.14,0:17:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know somebody's in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.98,0:17:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shitballs were busted as the PE teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.34,0:17:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.25,0:17:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's time to bail!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.17,0:17:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still haven't found my sandwich!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.62,0:17:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you can't get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No good, hooligans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.62,0:17:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought my tea and coffee\Nwasn't lasting very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.12,0:17:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going crazy,\Nbut I was just being used.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to start locking this\Nplace up tighter than Fort Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This day has been hellacious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:18:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But despite every setback, I beat the\Nodds and have been reunited with my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't explain it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've always had the feeling\Nthat somewhere out there
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.54,0:18:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is a guardian angel looking\Nover Yoshikage Kira's shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.74,0:18:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That in the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.02,0:18:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,things will work out for the best, and if\NI live every day with rigor and boldness,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.96,0:18:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll ultimately be delivered\Nfrom a wretched life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had a pretty close call today, my dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.94,0:18:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I knew we'd find our\Nway back to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found it now. Why is\Nsomeone I've never laid
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.36,0:18:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eyes on skulking off with\Nmy sandwich and while
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.66,0:18:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're on this subject\Nbuster why is some strange
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,man hanging around my\Nschool like it's another day
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at the office pardon you\Nwouldn't happen to be
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,talking to me would you\Nlittle boy because i haven't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.74,0:18:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the faintest idea what\Nyou're going on about if
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must know i just\Npurchased this item at St.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.11,0:18:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can save the bullshit\Nthat bag's my property.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.84,0:19:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could go on and on about\Nhow I know it's mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.82,0:19:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but someone like you\Nwould never understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.34,0:19:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to take back what's ours, Harvest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.04,0:19:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blasted!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.95,0:19:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.38,0:19:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bag's being ripped away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.86,0:19:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.40,0:19:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not my sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.90,0:19:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.24,0:19:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did that ham come from a real person?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's come to this, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My secret is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interestingly enough, you and I, it would\Nappear that we both share a unique power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.60,0:19:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.51,0:19:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.80,0:19:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you see my harvest?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.42,0:19:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not important right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.46,0:19:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you strutting around\Ncarrying a hand in your bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.50,0:19:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're by yourself, I presume.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.98,0:19:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see your playmates anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.84,0:19:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe their names\Nwere Josuke and Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.74,0:20:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would it be safe to assume they both\Nhave powers similar to ours? Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.48,0:20:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you move a single muscle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.88,0:20:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you so much as blink, you're a gutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.42,0:20:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My gut's saying you're\Nsome kind of closet weirdo,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I don't want you coming any closer,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so stay there if you\Nknow what's good for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just looking at your slimy faces starting\Nto make my skin crawl, You're evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and evil people need to stay far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can call me Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.38,0:20:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm currently 33 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that you'd care, but I reside\Nin Northeast Morio's Villa District.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.38,0:20:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, I've yet to marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to make a living, I work\Nfor Kameyo Department Stores.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.96,0:20:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After a long day's work, I\Nreturn home no later than 8 p .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.86,0:20:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like smoking,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.54,0:20:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but do enjoy the occasional drink\NI'm always in bed by 11pm And
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.28,0:20:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I make it a point to get no less\Nthan 8 hours of sleep each night
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:21:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before bed I drink a warm glass of milk\NIt's always coupled with 20 minutes of
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.16,0:21:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stretching to decompress\Nfrom the long work
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.12,0:21:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,day Sweet dreams are\Nthe usual result of this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.04,0:21:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I then awake as refreshed and\Nrecharged as a newborn child
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.62,0:21:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready to take on the day's\Nchallenges And after my last checkup,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.24,0:21:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was given a clean bill of health.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the big idea, Creeper?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.14,0:21:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you telling me this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.72,0:21:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For as long as I can remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.24,0:21:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done everything in my\Npower to live a productive
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.56,0:21:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,life that allows me to\Npursue a lasting inner peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This may be a foreign concept,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.16,0:21:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I choose not to concern\Nmyself with winning or losing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.16,0:21:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,life's troubles or enemies\Nwho bring sleepless nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.06,0:21:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is how I cope with this backwards\Nlife we find ourselves living.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what brings me happiness in a\Nworld fraught with hardship and misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.20,0:21:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, if I were\Never to engage in combat,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.40,0:21:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would win the battle without question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.96,0:21:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, Shigechi,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:22:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you are an irksome troublemaker\Nwho stands to hinder my sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.06,0:22:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, boy, are the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.84,0:22:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.90,0:22:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.50,0:22:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I named it myself, and truth be\Ntold, I'm quite proud of the moniker.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.58,0:22:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before you have the chance to\Nutter a word of this to another soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall eradicate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.60,0:22:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll sleep soundly tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.54,0:22:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can already feel it.
